                                        "entry_id": "c7d1ebea-405b-3621-ab06-d0ced7231fd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancient form of pen, much older than quill pens, made by carving a suitable nib into the end of a reed, or a stalk of slim bamboo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ancient",
